OL,3,GNEWSARowan Atkinson to honour
OL,4,Ainspiration for Mr Bean
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Rowan Atkinson will join one of
OL,7,FUK's longest-running rural film
OL,8,Ffestivals for an event honouring a
OL,9,FFrench comic genius who inspired Mr
OL,10,FBean.
OL,12,FFrom 16 October to 1 November, the
OL,13,FPurbeck Film Festival, which was
OL,14,Ffounded in 1996, will run screenings
OL,15,Fand events in Corfe Castle, village
OL,16,Fhalls, secret gardens, restaurants and
OL,17,Fstately homes across Dorset.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
