OL,3,GNEWSARowan Atkinson to honour
OL,4,Ainspiration for Mr Bean
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of them is a Jacques Tati day at
OL,7,FThe Mowlem theatre in Swanage -
OL,8,FAtkinson has credited the Academy Award
OL,9,Ffilmmaker, actor and mime as an
OL,10,Finspiration for his iconic comic
OL,11,Fcharacter.
OL,13,FFestival organisers said that exclusive
OL,14,Fpreviews, Cannes prize-winners, UK
OL,15,Fpremieres and local stories were also
OL,16,Fpart of its 30th anniversary programme.
